{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":192,"count":38,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-1-17\",\"美國\",\"美國\",\"美国\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A：他是哪國人？ B：他是美國人。","pinyin":"A: Tā shì nǎ guó rén? B: Tā shì Měiguó rén.","english":"A: Which country is he from? B: He is American.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-17","sourceFront":"美國","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"美(Měi) + 國(country) → Měi is the old sound for 'America': 美國(the USA)."},{"key":"[\"B1L01-2-02\",\"名字\",\"名字\",\"名字\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他叫什麼名字？你知道嗎？","pinyin":"Tā jiào shénme míngzi? Nǐ zhīdào ma?","english":"What is his name? Do you know?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-02","sourceFront":"名字","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"妳好！我是李中明，請問妳叫什麼名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ hǎo! Wǒ shì Lǐ Zhōngmíng, qǐngwèn nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","english":"Hi, my name is Li Zhongming. May I ask what your name is?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"名(given name) + 字(character) → the characters of a first name: 名字(name)."},{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-08\",\"外面\",\"外（面）\",\"外（面）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他在房間外面做什麼？","pinyin":"Tā zài fángjiān wàimiàn zuò shénme?","english":"What is he doing outside of the room?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-08","sourceFront":"外（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我的貓在房子外面曬太陽。","pinyin":"Wǒ de māo zài fángzi wàimiàn shài tàiyáng.","english":"My cat is basking in the sun outside the house.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-11","sourceFront":"曬太陽/晒太陽","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"外(outside) + 面(side) → the outside: 外面 means out."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-20\",\"說話\",\"說話\",\"说话\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我男朋友不太喜歡說話。","pinyin":"Wǒ nán péngyǒu bú tài xǐhuān shuōhuà.","english":"My boyfriend does not like to talk very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-20","sourceFront":"說話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"說(speak) + 話(speech) → 說話 means to talk."},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-09\",\"殺價\",\"殺價\",\"杀价\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在夜市買東西的時候，有些人會跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-10","sourceFront":"殺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那件名牌長裙才兩千元而已，用不著跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-20","sourceFront":"而已","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-04\",\"吃喝玩樂\",\"吃喝玩樂\",\"吃喝玩乐\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他每天只會吃喝玩樂，什麼都不做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-04","sourceFront":"吃喝玩樂","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"想找吃喝玩樂的朋友不難，想有一位知心的朋友卻不容易。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-23","sourceFront":"知心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-2-03\",\"前\",\"前\",\"前\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"前天下午我在學校的圖書館看書。","pinyin":"Qiántiān xiàwǔ wǒ zài xuéxiào de túshūguǎn kànshū.","english":"I read at the school library in the afternoon of the day before yesterday.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"窗戶前面有很多花，很漂亮。","pinyin":"Chuānghù qiánmiàn yǒu hěn duō huā, hěn piàoliàng.","english":"There are many flowers in front of the window. It’s very beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-05","sourceFront":"窗戶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 䒑(grass top) hides a 刖(blade) chopping at the feet in front → 前(the front)."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-07\",\"免費\",\"免費\",\"免费\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家咖啡館有免費的無線網路，我可以邊喝咖啡邊上網。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-08","sourceFront":"無線網路","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你得把保證書帶來，我們才能幫你免費修理電腦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-20","sourceFront":"修理","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A: 現在的科技提供非常好用的網路服務，而且很多都是免費的。 B: 好用倒是好用，可是萬一沒有網路，就什麼都做不了了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-05","sourceFront":"倒是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老闆舉辦了一個免費吃鬆餅的活動，目的是調查哪種口味的鬆餅最受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-10","sourceFront":"調查","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，要是滿兩千元，老闆就免費招待一盤炒青菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-41","sourceFront":"招待","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司福利不錯，每年除了提供免費健檢，老闆還會帶員工出國旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-30","sourceFront":"福利","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代企業越來越重視員工的福利和健康，例如提供免費的旅遊和健檢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-03","sourceFront":"企業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:公司從明天起就不再提供免費的三餐了。 B:這麼重大的決定，為什麼現在才通知我們？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-28","sourceFront":"重大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個國家光是依靠免費簽證，是無法吸引國外遊客來旅行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-32","sourceFront":"光是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院每個月都到鄉下地區免費為老人門診。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-07","sourceFront":"門診","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-14\",\"趕\",\"趕\",\"赶\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"因為我趕時間，所以得搭計程車去車站。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-14","sourceFront":"趕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個活動不好玩，大家都希望趕快結束。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-12","sourceFront":"結束","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他太晚起床，趕快刷了牙就去上班了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-07","sourceFront":"刷牙","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？昨天晚上沒睡好嗎？ B:嗯。要不是開夜車趕報告， 現在也不會這麼沒精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-36","sourceFront":"嗯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為有人喝酒後開車，造成了嚴重的交通意外，警察和救護車都趕來了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-34","sourceFront":"意外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的露營活動因為颱風辦不成了，可以說計畫永遠沒辦法趕上變化","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張老闆開會開得太久，沒趕上飛機，只好花錢再買一張機票了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐走路回家時發覺有人跟在她後面，嚇得她趕快跑進便利商店，不敢回家了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-07","sourceFront":"發覺","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震救災人員聽到東邊大約五公尺以外的地方，有人發出求救的聲音，就立刻趕過去救人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場大地震發生後不久，軍人就立刻趕到了災區，協助救災工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-26","sourceFront":"協助","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我沒趕上最後一班公車，這下子只好搭計程車回家了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的午餐時間很短，因此同事們總是吃得很趕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-47","sourceFront":"趕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你快點把衣服換好。還不出門，就趕不上飛機嘍？ B:好啦，我知道了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-07","sourceFront":"嘍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在超市隨手買了瓶飲料，回家後才發現有效日期快到了，只好趕快喝完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-22","sourceFront":"隨手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的會議改時間了，你趕緊通知大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-24","sourceFront":"趕緊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下午颱風就要來了，看樣子得趕快去超市買點兒食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-50","sourceFront":"看樣子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"You 走(walk) through the 旱(dry) desert, pressing on to 趕(pursue)."},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-01\",\"貼紙\",\"貼紙\",\"贴纸\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請不要把貼紙貼在教室的桌子上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-01","sourceFront":"貼紙","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我想要得到便利商店的貼紙，所以花了很多錢買東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-26","sourceFront":"花","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-18\",\"愛心\",\"愛心\",\"爱心\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社把社員的愛心聚在一起，到安養院去幫助老人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-15","sourceFront":"聚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多大學生參加愛心服務的社團，幫助老人打掃環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-09","sourceFront":"許多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小簡是一個有愛心、有禮貌的人，像這樣子的男人你要好好把握啊！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"發生大地震後，民眾都發揮愛心，主動提供救災的相關用品給災民。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-09","sourceFront":"相關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像食物銀行、愛心冰箱此類處理食物的做法，不但可以節省資源，還能幫助需要的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-05","sourceFront":"此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-28\",\"舅妈\",\"舅媽\",\"舅妈\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"陳可欣的舅舅和舅媽都在日本留過學，所以日語說得很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-27","sourceFront":"舅舅","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"每年冬天快到時，舅舅和舅媽就開始計畫去滑雪，有時還約我跟媽媽一起去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-17","sourceFront":"滑","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-04\",\"纪念\",\"紀念\",\"纪念\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個國家都有偉大的人物，值得大家紀念他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-04","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"「教師節」這個節日是為了紀念偉大的孔子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-05","sourceFront":"節日","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"每個國家都有偉大的人物，值得大家紀念他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-02","sourceFront":"偉大","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我買了幾張當地的明信片，這些是這次旅行很好的紀念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-37","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個紀念堂是為了紀念那些為國家犧牲生命的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-04","sourceFront":"為","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小文房內的櫃子裡擺了很多寶貝，都是他上山下海帶回來的紀念品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-16","sourceFront":"寶貝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"紀念郵票一般都是以歷史上的大事或重要人物當作主題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-42","sourceFront":"郵票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次畢業典禮，學校打算採用空拍的方式來拍紀念影片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-03","sourceFront":"空拍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在觀光景點銷售紀念品，價格通常比一般商店高一些。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-16","sourceFront":"紀念品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座圓形廣場是為了紀念自由而建的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-12","sourceFront":"圓形","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-08\",\"玩具\",\"玩具\",\"玩具\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我和姊姊小時候常為了搶玩具吵個沒完，有時候還打架呢","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:這個玩具雖然可愛，但是不適合送給剛滿月的孩子，我們還是送紅包吧！ B:也好。送紅包也不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-43","sourceFront":"也好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-2-19\",\"坪\",\"坪\",\"坪\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"臺灣一般舊公寓的房子大約三十多坪，有客廳、廚房、一間浴室和三間臥